      "values:originalText": "(3) In a case referred to in paragraph (1)(b), records kept, in relation to\nthe person, for the purposes of the Australian Capital Territory\nGovernment Service may be delivered to the relevant Secretary or\nAgency Head (within the meaning of the Public Service Act 1999)\nif it is reasonably necessary for the records to be so delivered in\nconnection with the employment of the person as an officer of the\nAustralian Public Service.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) In a case referred to in paragraph (1)(b), records kept, in relation to\nthe person, for the purposes of the Australian Capital Territory\nGovernment Service may be delivered to the relevant Secretary or\nAgency Head (within the meaning of the Public Service Act 1999)\nif it is reasonably necessary for the records to be so delivered in\nconnection with the employment of the person as an officer of the\nAustralian Public Service.",
