    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-government-service-consequential-provisions-act-1994-sec-9",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "9 Operation of Part IV of the Public Service Act in relation to",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-capital-territory-government-service-consequential-provisions-act-1994#sec-9"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-capital-territory-government-service-consequential-provisions-act-1994.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-government-service-consequential-provisions-act-1994.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "certain staff\n\n(1) If, but for this subsection, an officer to whom subsection 5(1)\napplies would have been, on the transfer day, an officer to whom a\nprovision of Part IV of the Public Service Act applied:\n\n(a) Part IV of that Act ceases, on the transfer day, to have any\napplication to the officer; and\n\n(b) in the case of an officer to whom a provision of Division 4 of\nPart IV of that Act would have applied, the repealed Officers’\nRights Declaration Act 1928 ceases, on the transfer day, to\nhave any application to the officer.\n\n(2) If:",
      "skos:definition": "certain staff\n\n(1) If, but for this subsection, an officer to whom subsection 5(1)\napplies would have been, on the transfer day, an officer to whom a\nprovision of Part IV of the Public Service Act applied:\n\n(a) Part IV of that Act ceases, on the transfer day, to have any\napplication to the officer; and\n\n(b) in the case of an officer to whom a provision of Division 4 of\nPart IV of that Act would have applied, the repealed Officers’\nRights Declaration Act 1928 ceases, on the transfer day, to\nhave any application to the officer.\n\n(2) If:",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-government-service-consequential-provisions-act-1994-sec-9-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-government-service-consequential-provisions-act-1994-sec-9-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bd94f5bdd09181a7f656166161dbf42ab89a07493201ef6f9007ae6eca60a37d"
    },
    {
