      "cml:integrityHash": "ea0092a34ad52983c5185ff8def3f60054c85fb09871be7446dc9309f4d1711c",
      "skos:note": "Public Service Act 1999 obligations for APS employees regarding leave entitlements"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-capital-territory-government-service-consequential-provisions-act-1994#sec-25-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "25(4) Leave entitlements",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 11,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Public Service Act 1999 has effect, in relation to the accrual,\non and after the engagement of a person as an APS employee, of\nthe person’s entitlement to leave of absence for recreation in\nrelation to a period since the person last gained an entitlement, as\nan ACT officer, to leave of absence for recreation as if service by\nthe person as an ACT officer during that period had been service as\nan APS employee."
    },
