      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-government-service-consequential-provisions-act-1994.pdf, p.11",
      "values:originalText": "(6) The reference in subsection (5) to a recreation leave loading is a\nreference to a payment that corresponds, or substantially\ncorresponds, to a payment under the APS Award 1998.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) The reference in subsection (5) to a recreation leave loading is a\nreference to a payment that corresponds, or substantially\ncorresponds, to a payment under the APS Award 1998.",
