      "skos:note": "Reference to APS Award 1998 payment"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-capital-territory-government-service-consequential-provisions-act-1994#sec-25-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "25(6) Leave entitlements",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 11,
      "values:originalText": "(6) The reference in subsection (5) to a recreation leave loading is a\nreference to a payment that corresponds, or substantially\ncorresponds, to a payment under the APS Award 1998."
